<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase"><B>DEPOSITARY
NOTICE OF ADS RATIO CHANGE / reverse split on polestar ads</B></FONT><B>s</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">To Holders of American Depositary Shares (&ldquo;<U>ADSs</U>&rdquo;)
of Polestar Automotive Holding UK PLC</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="3" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 47%; border: Black 1pt solid">Company:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 53%; border-top: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: justify">Polestar Automotive Holding UK PLC, a public limited company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales, and its successors.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Depositary:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">Citibank, N.A. </TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Custodian:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">Citibank, N.A. - London.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Existing ADS-to-Share Ratio:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: justify">Each ADS represents the right to receive one (1) fully paid Class C-2 preferred share of the Company (the &ldquo;<U>Share(s)</U>&rdquo;).</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">New ADS-to-Share Ratio:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: justify">Each ADS will represent the right to receive thirty (30) fully paid Class C-2 Shares.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Deposit Agreement:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: justify">Class C-2 Deposit Agreement, dated as of June 23, 2022 (the &ldquo;<U>Deposit Agreement</U>&rdquo;), by and among the Company, the Depositary, and the Holders and Beneficial Owners of ADSs issued thereunder, as proposed to be amended by Amendment No. 1 to Class C-2 Deposit Agreement (&ldquo;<U>Amendment No. 1</U>&rdquo;).</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">ADS Symbol:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">PLSAY.*</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Existing ADS CUSIP No.:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">731105300.*</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">New ADS CUSIP No.:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">731105508.*</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Existing ADS ISIN:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">US7311053000.*</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">New ADS ISIN:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">US7311055088.*</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">ADS Books Closure period for ADS Issuances and ADS Cancellations:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">December 2, 2025 (5:00 p.m. New York City time) until December 9, 2025 (5:00 p.m. New York City time).</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid">Effective Date:</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">December 9, 2025.</TD></TR>
